<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    body {
      background: var(--blue-900);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .expired-icon {
      font-size: 4rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes float { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateY(-10px)} }
    .expired-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 36px 28px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    }
    .expired-card h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: var(--danger);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .expired-card .subtitle {
      color: var(--gray-400);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .plans-mini {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 20px 0 24px;
    }
    .plan-mini {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 10px 6px;
    }
    .plan-mini .amt {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--mono);
    }
    .plan-mini .dur {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--gray-400);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--gray-400);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="expired-icon">⏱️</div>
  <div class="expired-card">
    <h1>Natapos na!</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Your session has expired.<br>
      <strong style="color:var(--white);">Naubos na ang iyong oras.</strong>
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--gray-400);margin-bottom:8px;">
      Bumili ng bagong voucher para makakonekta ulit.<br>
      <small>Purchase a new voucher to reconnect.</small>
    </p>
    <div class="plans-mini">
      <div class="plan-mini"><div class="amt">₱5</div><div class="dur">15 Min</div></div>
      <div class="plan-mini"><div class="amt">₱10</div><div class="dur">30 Min</div></div>
      <div class="plan-mini"><div class="amt">₱20</div><div class="dur">1 Oras</div></div>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">
      🔄 Kumuha ng Bagong Code / Get New Voucher
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-note">
    📍 39ers – EastBank Cainta<br>
    May tanong? Makipag-ugnayan kay Sam.
  </div>
</body>
</html>
